{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-12_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-12","title":"瞄準","storyCode":"10-14","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b02a924b3a7bf88b463dd1bb204d49a1926733edd0db5385c9e7d2faaa148a60","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"撤回地下據點的阿米婭小隊和自救軍一起，準備離開薩迪恩區。此時，薩卡茲突然對地面上的自救軍展開了清洗。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"10-beg"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少了十三個平民，九個士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們可真是給我添了不少麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，剩下的深池士兵清點完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給他們一個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"願意加入我們的，進雇傭兵編隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不願意的......你知道該怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說不上太精彩的戰果啊，曼弗雷德將軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒想到赦罪師的信使還未離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領和攝政王一樣，擔憂著這個不起眼角落的戰況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信血魔大君也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，昨夜他的慷慨出手為我們減輕了不少壓力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，大君托我轉告您，這附近的空氣過於渾濁，他並不打算耽擱太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此刻他勉強徵用了一位工廠主的住所，正在享用遲來的晚餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"徵用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望......被大君“徵用”的住所原主並不是我們的合作夥伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這很重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些效率不足的廠房並不能為我們提供多少有用的資源，留著反而滋生害蟲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大君的耐心只到下一個夜晚到來為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若您不能為他提供一場令他滿意的宴會的話，他會用自己的方式“掃蕩”這些骯髒的街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是大君的意思，還是軍事委員會的決定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您總是在這些無關緊要的細節上斤斤計較，這導致了您被牽絆在這彈丸之地，而殿下對您的期望顯然更高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......煩請回報大君，感謝他先前的援手，我們會立刻進行下一階段的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪師直屬衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。我們會一起期待您的表現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和王庭的人說話，是不是比上戰場還累？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你躲在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保證我沒偷懶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下你那條差點弄丟了的胳膊吧。說說看，這傷是被你的老熟人炸的，還是被另一個老熟人砍的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我疼得回憶不起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你還有另一隻手能用劍，看來她們還是留了一些情面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天快亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別靠在牆邊發呆了。休息時間到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵是沒有資格請假的，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，這場仗還遠遠沒有結束。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受傷的人有多少？立刻帶他們去治療！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我也來幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓哈默來見我。我們需要加快撤退的進度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......派信使出城。最壞的情況下，我們要做好將大部分人轉移去城外的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，指揮官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉，您的聲音總是讓我有些走神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定是太累了。我們的戰士也都很疲憊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我挺好的，多謝關心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶回來的那條情報——六隊的戰士是被極端恐怖的源石技藝殺害的，這對我們來說至關重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我沒有更早去地面確認他們的情況......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那樣的話你也會陷入危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你已經做得夠好了，要不是你足夠機敏，極有可能不止六隊，我們其他的戰士還有你們的人都會撞上他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是誰？那些薩卡茲士兵稱他為大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......三個月前，倫蒂尼姆北部曾經舉辦了一場貴族宴會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那場宴會在觥籌交錯中開始，燈火亮了一整夜，直到第二天早上，前去打掃的僕人才發現，整個宴會廳裡只剩下唱片機還有聲響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人都死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且幾乎都是在同一個瞬間被殺死的。在死亡到來的那一刻，他們之中的不少人都還維持著舉杯的姿勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死者中有好幾位都曾與我們保持聯繫。海蒂也認識他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那場宴會結束之後，我少了好幾位舊友，自救軍也斷了一整片區域的情報管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們退守到城牆邊緣......是有原因的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過多虧了海蒂的不懈努力，我們仍有力量保存下來，再過一段時間，我們就有機會與薩卡茲正面抗衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在此之前......我們仍需要從那位可怕的薩卡茲眼皮子底下全身而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你會不會恰好知道他是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我沒猜錯的話，此刻在我們頭頂活躍的，恐怕是一位......血魔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多困難？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，你讓我從頭做一個都比把這些碎片重新黏起來要容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有材料了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是在倫蒂尼姆。絕大多數工業材料都被薩卡茲控制著，我很難再碰巧扒出一些合適的廢品，去做一個戰場上用不著的玩具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這工作環境也太......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒酸？你想說就說吧，指揮官不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太具有挑戰性了吧，咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你知道嗎？在說到有挑戰的時候，你的兩隻眼睛都在......“實體層面”地放光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？有嗎？可能我是有些興奮......會不會很嚇人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還......還行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，認識你之後，我才知道......呃，薩卡茲也不是只會打架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......噢，是也有不怎麼會打架的，比如說我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然囉，我是血魔嘛，也多少有一些好用的天賦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇？你你你......你這速度？你一夜之間能做完我一星期的工作吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然你以為羅德島的支柱是那麼好當的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看我的眼睛，要是羅德島整船都是血魔，夜間工作不用愁，電費支出都能砍一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔裡......有很多工程師嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能啊！他們......他們都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你怎麼打了個寒顫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這得怪倫蒂尼姆。我很久沒有這種靠近邪惡老巢的恐怖感應了。你看，我引以為豪的手都僵住了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說，六隊他們遇見的就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是的話......我得給你們一個非常嚴肅的警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一......萬一你們撞見另一個血魔，跑，趕緊跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，在撞見他們的那一刻，你們也許已經沒機會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你們永遠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠不要遇見他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，你和因陀羅去協助自救軍轉移。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也馬上就過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"維娜。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......來找我的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我想談談達格達的事。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達......她有自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......即使我必須成為她們的領頭人，我也一直在思索，我該怎麼做才是最合適的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在羅德島，我看到了你是怎麼做的。"}]},{"label":"你感覺怎麼樣？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好......只是，我很擔心達格達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這就跟你此刻在擔心我一樣，博士。這是我們必須承擔的。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達......她和我處境很相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她跟在我身邊的每一刻，她的行動都被責任束縛著，我嘴上說再多次讓她選，她都不可能選出另一種結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我們真正有選擇餘地的時候，所謂選擇的權利才是真實的。否則的話，那只是一種變相的逼迫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再看見她被推著走。她需要接納自己的內心，然後堅定日後的道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的選擇呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你可以像這樣做一名普通戰士。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你也可以向他們承認你的身份。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"無論你做什麼決定，我和羅德島都支持你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做一名單純的戰士，說不定是一件更簡單的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的姓氏......無論你們怎麼稱呼我，我都無法否認自己的姓氏。這是我與生俱來的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"希望我吐露的真相並沒有嚇到你，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生說可以由她開口，但我決定自己告訴你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的姓氏......維多利亞？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情......好平靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"也許因為我不記得過去。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"......不記得過去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你一定因此承受了不少痛苦......但我忍不住想，要是真的不記得過去，是不是能過得更輕鬆些？"}]},{"label":"也許因為我只關心現在。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......最重要的，永遠是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"在決定離開維多利亞的時候，我想要的，也不過就是此時此刻我和因陀羅她們都能活著而已。"}]},{"label":"也許因為我更著眼未來。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"未來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"我的未來......會走向何方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"這個問題只有我自己才能回答。沒有人能告訴我答案。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......和你相處，我總是這麼容易就放鬆下來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是因為......就連你得知真相的這一刻，當你看著我的時候，你的眼裡依然只是我這個叫“推進之王”的幹員......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"而不是......維多利亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到倫蒂尼姆之後，我找到了許多回憶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與此同時，我也看到了更多變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所做出的每一個決定，已經不再僅僅關係著我們小隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......我並不希望“選擇”成為一個使我停滯不前的藉口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是一個個選擇讓我走到今天。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"是一個個選擇決定了前進的方向。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有人跟我說，我會找到我的道路。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"維娜，這句話，我也想送給你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你永遠都有選擇的權利。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海蒂女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭？我正在照看我們這些受傷的戰士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......還會醫術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一些粗淺的護理知識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份工作難免會讓我遇到一些危急時刻，為了讓我和朋友們有更多活下來的機會，我至少得學會應急藥箱怎麼用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們做的不過是守護自己的家園。而凱爾希......還有你，阿米婭，你們肩負著更多的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在這次行動中，我們損失了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我感受到了自救軍戰士的痛苦。他們之前對付的敵人都沒有那麼可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位血魔大君......他之所以會來這裡，是不是因為我們的出現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你需要的並不是一個否定的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭說過，她擔心我和羅德島將自救軍捲入不屬於他們的戰場中去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果合作的確給他們帶來了更大的危險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨夜的行動，假如沒有羅德島的參與，會發生什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有W裡應外合，沒有她擋住那位雇傭兵首領......也沒有其他羅德島幹員牽制曼弗雷德，我們之間的這場交談根本沒有機會發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用一些人命去換另一些人命的計算方式，對於羅德島來說，當然並不成立——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但即便是凱爾希在這裡，她也一定會說，任何機遇都伴隨著風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是為什麼我們必須做更多準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士，我需要更多城內的情報。除了血魔大君，薩卡茲還有哪幾位王在倫蒂尼姆？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩給我一袋麵包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，我不要你們的錢了。這些麵包你都拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊走吧，以後都別再上街了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你們是誰。其實，我們都看得出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你們脫下了裝備，換了衣服，你們的眼神和動作都騙不了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也要回家了。我看今天這生意是做不成了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這條街挨個搜一遍！凡是在名單上的，全部帶走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼了？我......我就是個做餐館生意的啊，您之前不還在我這吃過炸鱗肉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"抓的就是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你藏得還挺深啊，白天賣炸肉給我們，晚上立刻給反抗軍送消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"帶走！還有隔壁鐘錶店的老闆，這些都是反抗軍的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼薩卡茲會突然四處抓人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快走，從前面巷子裡拐進去，去找其他人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"這個也解決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，追進前面巷子裡，往其他城區跑的，一個都別放過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g12_satellite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告，我們剛出來就撞上了薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他們不是守著我們的出城通道，就是突然在半道上冒出來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，難道是我們的通訊訊息被截獲了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定要小心......派出城的戰士已經全部犧牲了......我也躲不了多久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，怎麼都甩不掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲好像突然摸清楚了我們在地面上的全部行動路線！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......只是一夜之間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上到底發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，你們沒機會知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——？什麼人？為什麼我的刀斷了一截——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您這身打扮......您是羅德島幹員？謝謝......羅德島又救了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"快回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"不，轉告博士和阿米婭，地下也不安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天我們遇到的陷阱......不止我們已經發現的那些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_112_seige","aliases":["推進之王"]}]}
